        "id": 547053015,
        "iid": 4090,
        "project_id": 34675721,
        "title": "Draft: fix(issue): resolve issue instance / project correctly",
        "description": "## Description\n\nWhen passing issues to glab as URL, issues could be from other gitlab instances; but IssueFromArg / IssueFromArgs didn't return this information.\n\nAs a result, later operations (like looking up comments with `glab issue view --comments` ) were done against the wrong gitlab instance and failed.\n\nTo solve this, return a full Client / Repository / Issue tuple that can be used by the caller.\n\n## Related Issues\n\nResolves #8084\n\n## How has this been tested?\n\nVerified that `glab issue view --comments https://other-gitlab.internal/...` from a gitlab git repository now returns the correct results (used to error with 404 or 401 after querying the git repo's gitlab instance)\n\nAdded regression tests\n\n## Screenshots (if appropriate):",
