      {
        "id": 546876490,
        "iid": 4089,
        "project_id": 34675721,
        "title": "docs: fix dead handbook and docs links in contributor docs",
        "description": "## Description\n\nSeven links in the contributor and maintainer docs point to pages that moved. The handbook links return 404, the release docs link redirects to the root of the `release/docs` repository, and two docs.gitlab.com links use anchors that no longer exist on the page. This MR points each one at the current page. Only URLs change.\n\n| File | Old | New |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `docs/maintainer.md` (2 links) | `handbook/business-technology/end-user-services/onboarding-access-requests/access-requests/` (404) | `handbook/eta/corporate-it/end-user-services/access-requests/` |\n| `docs/triaging_bugs.md` | `handbook/engineering/infrastructure/engineering-productivity/issue-triage/#severity` (404) | `handbook/product-development/how-we-work/issue-triage/#severity` |\n| `SECURITY.md` | `handbook/security/product-security/application-security/vulnerability-management/#vulnerability-vs-feature-vs-bug` (404) | `handbook/security/product-security/security-platforms-architecture/application-security/vulnerability-management/#vulnerability-vs-feature-vs-bug` |\n| `docs/security_releases.md` | `release/docs/-/blob/master/general/security/developer.md` (file renamed) | `release/docs/-/blob/master/general/security/engineer.md` |\n| `CONTRIBUTING.md` | `cli_styleguide/#deprecation-messages` (no such anchor) | `cli_styleguide/#deprecations` |\n| `docs/development_process.md` | `automatic_reviewer_assignment/#assign-reviewers-with-the-recommend-reviewers-flow` (no such anchor) | `automatic_reviewer_assignment/#recommend-reviewers-flow` |\n\nEach new page covers the same topic as the old link: the Access Requests page, the Issue Triage page with its Severity section, the Application Vulnerability Management Procedure with its \"Vulnerability vs. Feature vs. Bug?\" section, the release docs engineer guide (`developer.md` was renamed to `engineer.md` in `release/docs@6f229680`), the CLI style guide Deprecations section, and the Recommend Reviewers flow section.\n\n## Related issues and merge requests\n\nNone.\n\n## Documentation\n\nNo CLI command docs change, so `make gen-docs` is not needed.\n\n## How was this checked?\n\n- `curl -sL -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code} %{url_effective}'` on each old URL: 404 for the three handbook links; the `developer.md` link ends at `release/docs/-/tree/master`.\n- Same command on each new URL: 200. Each `#anchor` is an `id` in the live page HTML.\n- `release/docs` commit `6f229680` renames `general/security/developer.md` to `general/security/engineer.md`.\n\nThis contribution was prepared with the help of an AI assistant. I reviewed the changes and take responsibility for them.",
